       \"Logo Design\",\n        \"Branding\",\n        \"Marketing Materials\",\n        \"Web Design\",\n        \"Typography\",\n        \"Color Theory\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my graphic design expertise and passion for creating impactful visual solutions in a challenging and innovative environment.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://aishakhanportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
