"Branding\",\n        \"UI/UX Design\",\n        \"Logo Design\",\n        \"Typography\",\n        \"Adobe Creative Suite\",\n        \"Figma\",\n        \"User Research\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design position where I can leverage my skills and creativity to contribute to innovative and impactful projects.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.eleanorvancedesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
