uite\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Adobe Certified Expert - Photoshop\",\n        \"Adobe Certified Associate - Illustrator\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my expertise in branding and design to a forward-thinking organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"www.eleanorvance.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
