contribute my creative skills and passion for design to a challenging and rewarding role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://avachen.design\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-26\"\n}"}
