tion where I can utilize my skills in print design to create impactful marketing materials.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.bencarterdesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-04-30\"\n}"}
