esign\",\n        \"Brand Identity\",\n        \"Typography\",\n        \"Color Theory\",\n        \"Adobe Creative Suite\",\n        \"UI/UX Design\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Adobe Certified Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design position where I can utilize my creativity and skills to contribute to impactful branding solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicewonderland.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
