UI/UX design role in a fast-paced technology company.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://danielcarter.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-02-01\"\n}"}
