 utilize my skills and creativity to contribute to innovative projects.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnson.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-11-25\"\n}"}
