to create impactful branding solutions for innovative companies.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsondesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
