pp Design\",\n        \"Wireframing\",\n        \"Prototyping\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging UI/UX design position where I can leverage my skills and creativity to create innovative and user-friendly designs.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicesmithportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
