xperience to a challenging and rewarding graphic design role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-05-15\"\n}"}
