ful visual solutions for innovative companies.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicewonderland.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2023-12-02\"\n}"}
