rtise to a challenging and rewarding role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsondesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-11-20\"\n}"}
