my creative skills and experience to a challenging and rewarding graphic design role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicewonderlanddesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2023-11-25\"\n}"}
