design skills to create user-centered and visually appealing digital products.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicesmithdesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
