ls and creativity to contribute to a dynamic and innovative team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-01\"\n}"}
