design skills and experience to create impactful branding solutions for innovative companies.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsonportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-05-01\"\n}"}
