"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my creative skills and design expertise to a challenging and innovative role within a dynamic team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsondesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-11-25\"\n}"}
