nd creativity to create impactful user experiences.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsonportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2023-12-19\"\n}"}
