skills and creativity to contribute to a dynamic and innovative team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"www.anyasharmadesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-10-15\"\n}"}
