ive skills and experience to a dynamic team and deliver impactful design solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-11-15\"\n}"}
