],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design position where I can leverage my skills and creativity to contribute to a successful team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-26\"\n}"}
