\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design role where I can contribute my creativity and skills to develop impactful visual solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-10-15\"\n}"}
