allenging and rewarding design role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-12-01\"\n}"}
