-15\"\n}"}
{"_id": "resume_search--graphic_design:_--p--69703", "text": "{\n    \"design_software_proficiency\": [\n        \"Adobe Photoshop\",\n        \"Adobe Illustrator\",\n        \"Figma\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_samples\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Branding Project for Tech Startup\",\n            \"description\": \"Developed a complete brand identity for a new tech startup, including logo, color palette, and brand guidelines.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://example.com/portfolio/techstartup\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Website Mockup\",\n            \"description\": \"Designed a high-fidelity mockup for a website homepage.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://example.com/portfolio/website\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"design_specialization\": \"Branding\",\n    \"creative_process\": \"I start with thorough research and sketching, then move to digital mockups and iterative feedback.\",\n    \"client_work_experience\": \"I have 3+ years of experience collaborating directly with clients, understanding their needs, and delivering designs that exceed their expectations.\",\n    \"design_awards\": [],\n    \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n    \"contact_information\": {\n        \"email\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\",\n        \"phone\": \"555-123-4567\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Anytown, USA\"\n    },\n    \"education\": [\n        {\n            \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Fine Arts in Graphic Design\",\n            \"university\": \"University of Arts\",\n            \"year\": 2020\n        }\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Graphic Designer\",\n            \"company\": \"Design Agency X\",\n            \"duration\": \"2020 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Logo Design\",\n        \"Typography\",\n        \"Color Theory\",\n        \"UI Design\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design role where I can leverage my skills and creativity to contribute to a successful team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
