UX Design\",\n        \"Branding\",\n        \"Typography\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Adobe Certified Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my design skills and creativity to a challenging and rewarding role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsondesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-10-25\"\n}"}
