ills and experience to create impactful visual solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.eleanorvance.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-11-15\"\n}"}
