allenging and rewarding graphic design position.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicesmithdesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-11-20\"\n}"}
