ize my skills and creativity to contribute to the success of a dynamic team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-07-28\"\n}"}
