e\": \"Seeking a challenging UI/UX design role where I can leverage my skills and creativity to create impactful user experiences.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
