tive\": \"To contribute my creativity and design skills to a challenging and innovative environment.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"www.eleanorvanceportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
