{"_id": "resume_search--graphic_design:_--p--70106", "text": "{\n    \"design_software_proficiency\": [\n        \"Adobe Photoshop\",\n        \"Adobe Illustrator\",\n        \"Adobe InDesign\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_samples\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Branding for 'EcoBloom'\",\n            \"description\": \"Complete branding package for a sustainable floral company, including logo design, color palette, typography, and marketing collateral. Focused on conveying a natural and elegant aesthetic through visual storytelling.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://example.com/ecobloom\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"UI/UX Design for 'TravelEase'\",\n            \"description\": \"Redesign of a travel booking app's user interface, focusing on improved user experience and visual appeal. Included wireframing, prototyping, and visual design.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://example.com/travelease\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"design_specialization\": \"Branding\",\n    \"creative_process\": \"My creative process starts with thorough research and understanding the client's brand values and target audience. I then develop multiple concepts, iterate based on feedback, and ensure the final design effectively communicates the intended message with impactful visuals.\",\n    \"client_work_experience\": \"I have over 5 years of experience collaborating with clients on diverse design projects, consistently meeting deadlines and exceeding expectations. I excel at translating client needs into visually compelling solutions.\",\n    \"design_awards\": [\n        \"AIGA Design Award - 2022\",\n        \"Golden Pixel Award - 2021\"\n    ],\n    \"name\": \"Eleanor Vance\",\n    \"contact_information\": {\n        \"email\": \"eleanor.vance@email.com\",\n        \"phone\": \"555-123-4567\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main Street, Anytown, USA\"\n    },\n    \"education\": [\n        {\n            \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Fine Arts in Graphic Design\",\