sign\",\n        \"Adobe Creative Suite\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Adobe Certified Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design role where I can leverage my creativity and experience to create impactful visual solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.eleanorvance.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-01\"\n}"}
