UX Design\",\n        \"Logo Design\",\n        \"Typography\",\n        \"Adobe Creative Suite\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"objective\": \"To leverage my skills and experience in graphic design to create impactful and innovative visual solutions for a dynamic organization.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
