English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://bobwilliamsart.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-04-15\"\n}"}
{"_id": "resume_search--graphic_design:_--p--70784", "text": "{\n    \"design_software_proficiency\": [\n        \"Adobe Photoshop\",\n        \"Adobe Illustrator\",\n        \"Figma\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_samples\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Branding for 'EcoBloom'\",\n            \"description\": \"Complete branding package including logo, color palette, and style guide.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://example.com/ecobloom\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Website Mockups\",\n            \"description\": \"UI design for a responsive e-commerce website.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://example.com/website\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"design_specialization\": \"Branding & UI/UX\",\n    \"creative_process\": \"I start with understanding the client's vision and target audience, followed by extensive research, sketching, and digital prototyping. I prioritize iterative feedback and collaboration throughout the process.\",\n    \"client_work_experience\": \"Over 5 years of experience collaborating directly with clients to deliver impactful design solutions. I've managed projects from initial concept to final delivery, ensuring client satisfaction and alignment with their brand goals.\",\n    \"design_awards\": [\n        \"Design Excellence Award 2022\"\n    ],\n    \"name\": \"Aria Chen\",\n    \"contact_information\": {\n        \"email\": \"aria.chen@email.com\",\n        \"phone\": \"+1-555-123-4567\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Anytown, USA\"\n    },\n    \"education\": [\n        {\n            \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Fine Arts in Graphic Design\",\n            \"university\": \"Art Institute of Anytown\",\n            \"year\": 2018\n        }\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Senior Graphic Designer\",\n            \"company\": \"Creative Solutions Inc.\",\n            \"duration\": \"2019 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Adobe Creative Suite\",\n      