raphy\",\n        \"Adobe Creative Suite\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Adobe Certified Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging and rewarding graphic design position where I can utilize my skills and creativity to contribute to a collaborative and innovative team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
