{"_id": "resume_search--graphic_design:_--p--71037", "text": "{\n    \"design_software_proficiency\": [\n        \"Adobe Photoshop\",\n        \"Adobe Illustrator\",\n        \"Adobe InDesign\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_samples\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Brand Identity for 'EcoBloom'\",\n            \"description\": \"Complete brand identity including logo, color palette, typography, and brand guidelines, focusing on a natural and sustainable aesthetic.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Website Mockups for 'Tech Solutions'\",\n            \"description\": \"UI/UX design for a tech company's website, emphasizing user experience and modern design principles.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"design_specialization\": \"Branding\",\n    \"creative_process\": \"My design process is heavily user-centered. I start with thorough research to understand the target audience and their needs, followed by iterative sketching, prototyping, and user testing to ensure the final design is both aesthetically pleasing and functionally effective.\",\n    \"client_work_experience\": \"I have extensive experience collaborating directly with clients throughout the design process, from initial concept development to final delivery. I excel at understanding client needs and translating them into effective visual solutions.\",\n    \"design_awards\": [\n        \"Design Excellence Award 2022\"\n    ],\n    \"name\": \"Aria Thompson\",\n    \"contact_information\": {\n        \"email\": \"aria.thompson@email.com\",\n        \"phone_number\": \"555-123-4567\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main Street, Anytown, USA\"\n    },\n    \"education\": [\n        {\n            \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Fine Arts in Graphic Design\",\n            \"university\": \"Art Institute of Anytown\",\n            \"year\": 2020\n        }\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n        {\n            \"role\": \"Graphic Designer\",\n            \"company\": \"Creative Solutions Agency\",\n       