e collaborating directly with clients to understand their needs and deliver effective design solutions.\",\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://anyasharma.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\",\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Adobe Certified Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging role where I can leverage my design skills to create impactful and innovative visual solutions.\"\n}"}
