a challenging and innovative design role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.ariarodriguezdesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
