ective\": \"To create seamless and user-friendly digital experiences.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://ethanmillerdesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-04-01\"\n}"}
