"client_work_experience\": \"Extensive experience collaborating with clients to understand their needs and deliver designs that meet their expectations.\",\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://eleanorvanceportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\",\n    \"certifications\": [],\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging graphic design role where I can utilize my skills and creativity to contribute to a successful team.\",\n    \"design_awards\": []\n}"}
