esting\",\n        \"Figma\",\n        \"Sketch\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"Certified UX Professional\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my UI/UX expertise to a forward-thinking company focused on user-centered design.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://bobwilliams.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-04-30\"\n}"}
