Identity\",\n    \"creative_process\": \"My creative process is heavily user-centric. I begin with thorough research to understand the target audience and their needs, followed by sketching, prototyping, and iterative feedback.\",\n    \"client_work_experience\": \"I have over 3 years of experience collaborating with clients, managing expectations, and delivering designs that meet their objectives.\",\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.aishakhandesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-07-15\"\n}"}
