"objective\": \"To gain experience and develop my skills as a graphic designer in a fast-paced environment.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-05-15\"\n}"}
