contribute my creative expertise and passion for branding to a dynamic and innovative team.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.anyasharmadesign.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
